<title>NORWAY: UBN 9-mo profits down.</title>
<headline>UBN 9-mo profits down.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>				    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net interest income		 1,879	 vs	 2,087</p>
<p> Total other income		  1,128	 vs	   947</p>
<p> Total operating expenses	  2.043	 vs	 1,926</p>
<p> Operating result before losses    964	 vs	 1,108</p>
<p> Operating profit before tax     1.061	 vs	 1,105</p>
<p> Net result				775	 vs	   836</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norway's biggest savings bank is Union Bank of Norway, known locally as Sparebanken NOR. Analysts had forecast a net result of 770 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
